# Step 005 — ADD_COMPONENT UICOMP_XDUO_0005 CategoryControls

```step
anchor: ADD_COMPONENT
id: UICOMP_XDUO_0005
name: CategoryControls
kind: component
language: fsharp
declaring_project: OpticalConstructor.Controls
touches: [OpticalConstructor.Controls, OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests]
depends_on: [4]
```

**How to implement.** Create OpticalConstructor.Controls/CategoryControls.fs copying the domain-free LibraryControls shape (pure Row and State records, a Handlers record of unit-returning functions, one [<RequireQualifiedAccess>] module UiIds of [<Literal>] intent-named ids): a category list with an inline name box per row and Add / Rename(save) / Remove verbs, a built-in row whose name is editable but whose Remove is omitted (removed, not greyed), and an inline block-message slot for CategoryStillReferenced / BuiltInNotRemovable. Stable intent-named ids: CategoriesList, AddCategoryButton, CategoryNameBox, RemoveCategoryButton, CategorySaveButton, CategoryCancelButton, CategoryBlockMessage. The control renders the rows it is given and never touches a proxy (the host flattens). Headless structure test in OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests: mount the view over a known State, assert every UiIds control exists, and assert a simulated Add click invokes the add handler.

**Acceptance.** After the step, the headless test MUST mount CategoryControls over a known State, find every UiIds control, and observe that a simulated Add click invokes the add handler.
